-- EU AI Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689), serious-incident reporting by providers.
-- DRAFT. Not for use as advice. Not reviewed by a domain expert or by a lawyer
-- qualified in EU law. See NOTES.md.
--
-- The domain module: nouns only. Every field is a fact a provider could state,
-- or a judgment the Regulation leaves to someone else and this encoding asks
-- as a fact. No rules, no directives.
--
-- Seat: the PROVIDER (a company or other body that develops an AI system or a
-- general-purpose AI model and places it on the market under its own name).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

§ `Domain`

-- Which text is read. The Regulation as published in the Official Journal of
-- 12.7.2024, or that text as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744 (the
-- "Digital Omnibus on AI", in force 27 July 2026). Vintages are inputs and are
-- never merged.
DECLARE `version of the Regulation` IS ONE OF
    `as enacted`
    `as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744`

-- How the provider's AI system is high-risk, if it is (Article 6). Whether a
-- system is high-risk is not worked out here: Article 6 and Annexes I and III
-- are out of scope, so the provider states the route.
DECLARE `high-risk route` IS ONE OF
    `not a high-risk AI system`
    `Article 6(1), product under Section A of Annex I`
    `Article 6(1), product under Section B of Annex I`
    `Article 6(2), listed in Annex III`

-- To whom a report or notification goes.
DECLARE `recipient` IS ONE OF
    `no report is required of me`
    `the market surveillance authorities of the Member States where the incident occurred`
    `the national competent authority chosen by the Member State where the incident occurred`
    `the AI Office`
    `the AI Office and, as appropriate, national competent authorities`
    `the Commission`

-- By when. The source names the cases where it gives no number of days, so
-- they get a constructor of their own and never a borrowed number.
DECLARE `deadline` IS ONE OF
    `no duty applies to me`
    `no later than` HAS `the last day` IS A DATE
    `no period stated` HAS `the words the text uses` IS A STRING

-- What may be done to me: the most I can be fined.
DECLARE `maximum fine` IS ONE OF
    `no duty applies, so no fine for breaching it`
    `up to` HAS `euros` IS A NUMBER
    `no maximum in this Regulation: the Member State rules under Article 99(1)`
    `no power to fine under this provision applies on that date`

-- The provider's size, for Article 99(6) and, as amended, Article 99(6a).
DECLARE `size of the provider` IS ONE OF
    `an SME, including a start-up`
    `an SMC, a small mid-cap enterprise`
    `another undertaking`
    `not an undertaking`

-- One high-risk AI system, as its provider would describe it.
DECLARE `AI system facts` HAS
    `I develop the system or have it developed`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `I place the system on the market or put it into service`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the system carries my own name or trademark`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the route by which the system is high-risk`                                  IS A `high-risk route`
    `the system has been placed on the Union market`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date the system was first placed on the market or put into service`      IS A DATE
    `the date of the latest significant change to its design, if any`            IS A MAYBE DATE
    `the system is intended to be used by public authorities`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the system is based on a general-purpose AI model from me or my undertaking` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the system is listed in point 2 of Annex III`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the system is listed in point 8 of Annex III for the administration of justice` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the system is provided by an authority or financial institution within Article 74(6)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the system is or is part of a designated very large online platform or search engine` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the system is or is a safety component of a device under Regulation 2017/745 or 2017/746` IS A BOOLEAN
    `I am subject to Union instruments with equivalent incident-reporting obligations` IS A BOOLEAN

-- One incident, as the provider would describe it. "Serious" and "irreversible"
-- are judgments; they are asked as facts.
DECLARE `incident facts` HAS
    `it is an incident or malfunctioning of the AI system`                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `it led, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to the health of a person`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `it led, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of critical infrastructure` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it led, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of Union-law obligations protecting fundamental rights` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is an act or omission contrary to Union law protecting the interest of individuals` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of other Member States whose residents it harmed or is likely to harm`   IS A NUMBER
    `it has common features, such as the same unlawful practice or interest infringed`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is committed by the same operator`                                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of Member States in which it is occurring concurrently`                  IS A NUMBER
    `the date I became aware of it`                                                      IS A DATE

-- One general-purpose AI model, as its provider would describe it.
DECLARE `model facts` HAS
    `I develop the model or have it developed`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `I place the model on the market under my own name or trademark`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is a general-purpose AI model`                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the cumulative training computation in floating point operations`     IS A NUMBER
    `an evaluation with appropriate technical tools found high impact capabilities` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Commission has designated it a model with systemic risk`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Commission has accepted my Article 52(2) arguments`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `the date the model was first placed on the market`                    IS A DATE
